\**{c=red:Note:}** Purchase a {@k} {k:Magicked astrolabe} from {n:Churano-Shurano} in {z:Windurst Waters} (F-8) to open the doors in the {z:Eldieme Necropolis} solo. Opening the doors in {z:Eldieme Necropolis} is required for this Mission.
=2 Walkthrough
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* **(Optional)**: The following are optional steps you can take.
** Interact with the two doors to the **Princes' Quarters** for short cutscenes.
** Speak with {p:Curilla} and {p:Rahal} for small talk about the previous Mission. They will also have different dialogue after the KIs are obtained but before the Mission is completed.
* Go to the {z:Chateau|Chateau d'Oraguille} and check the **Great Hall** door for a cutscene.
* You must now travel to 3 **???** and obtain 3 {p:Key Items|Key Item}.

\**{c=red:Note:}** The following steps must be done in order.
=3 Valley of Sorrows
* In {z:Valley of Sorrows}, if you don't have a mount like the chocobo or raptor then {s:Sneak} and {p:Invisible|Invisible (Status)} across to (I-8) and check the **???** to receive the {@k} {k:Figure of Titan}.
** The {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Valley of Sorrows} is the same entrance.
** Alternatively, the {p:Unity Warp} (Level 135) for {z:Valley of Sorrows} may be used.
** Otherwise go to {z:Cape Teriggan} and head to the (J-8) entrance to {z:Valley of Sorrows}. This is the same entrance used for {p:Adamantoise}/{m:Aspidochelone}.

=3 Xarcabard
* Head for {z:Xarcabard} and go to (H-7) upper level.
** The {p:Survival Guide} for {z:Xarcabard} brings you to (H-9), almost due south of the ramp you need to ascend.
* The **???** is in a group of 3 clustered trees with their leaves to the west of the ramp (still in H-7).
* Select the **???** to obtain the {@k} {k:Figure of Garuda}.

=3 Batallia Downs
\**{c=red:Note:}** Purchase a {@k} {k:Magicked astrolabe} from {n:Churano-Shurano} in {z:Windurst Waters} (F-8) to open the doors in the {z:Eldieme Necropolis} by yourself.
* Head for the southern {z:Eldieme Necropolis} entrance at (J/I-10) in {z:Batallia Downs}.
** The {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Eldieme Necropolis} is located just inside this entrance.
* Make your way to the southern room, and then to the center hole at (G-9). You will likely need {s:Sneak} in the basement, do so before dropping down.
* Now on map 2, Follow the immediate path heading East to reach map 3. Head to the exit at (J-9) into {z:Batallia Downs}.
** Optional: If {m:Ahtu} is up, kill it first, it should not pose a problem to anyone in the party.
* Check the **???** (J-11) near the cliff to spawn two {p:Greater Bird|Category:Greater Bird} NMs: {m:Suparna} ({p:WAR}) and {m:Suparna Fledgling} ({p:WHM}).
** Note: There are multiple **???** on this island. Check the one near the {p:Stone Monument} at the rear of this island.
** They can both use {s:Horde Lullaby} and {s:Massacre Elegy} as well as their own respective abilities, such as {p:Mighty Strikes} and {p:Benediction}, and typical Greater Bird TP attacks.
* Defeat both NMs, once the corpses despawn check the **???** again to receive a cutscene and the {@k} {k:Figure of Leviathan}.
* Head back to the {z:Chateau|Chateau d'Oraguille} and check the **Great Hall** door for a final cutscene, completing the Mission.

